<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">forecast</ansi>

Weather Sense is a wizard's, a witch's and a shaman's skill. With a forecaster in your company,
<ansi fg="command">weather</ansi> also tells you what the sky will do next. The weather is
settled a change ahead, so a forecast is never wrong; only the detail
depends on the forecaster.

<ansi fg="yellow-bold">What each level reads</ansi>

  Level 1  which way it turns: colder, clouding over, harder going...
  Level 2  what comes next: "a storm is coming"
  Level 3  about when, in game hours
  Level 4  also the neighbouring zones your exits lead into

<ansi fg="yellow-bold">Usage:</ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">weather</ansi>
  The weather here, with the forecast after it.

  <ansi fg="command">autoskill weather off</ansi> leaves the forecast out.

See also: <ansi fg="command">help weather</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help specialists</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help travel</ansi>.
